      "id": "sol.amc-10b-2005-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The statement translates to \\[ \\dfrac{x}{100}\\cdot x = 4, \\] so \\(x^2 = 400.\\)\n\nSince \\(x\\) is positive, \\(x = 20.\\)\n\nThus, D is the correct answer.",
